{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29939","headline":"宿仙都观阴王二君修道处 · 薛莹","name":"宿仙都观阴王二君修道处","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十载别仙峰，峰前千古踪。\n阴王修道处，云雪满高松。\n洞口风雷异，池心星汉重。\n明朝下山去，片月落残钟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛莹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29939.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29939","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}